{
  "Npcs.HarpyMob.Desc": "You are surrounded by a wing of particularly large and muscular harpies, perhaps a dozen of them in total. All of them are clad in simple brown shifts that give them good camouflage in the mountains, and are using their talon-like claws as weapons against you. While not a great threat to a champion of your ability individually, a whole brood of them together is... something else entirely."
  "Npcs.HarpyMob.Name": "harpy horde"
}
